# SYNTHETIC SROM contents (revision 11) for a two antenna BCM4360 card.
#
# These are NOT read from a MacBook.  They are plausible values of the kind
# found in published NVRAM listings of BCM4360 boards, chosen only so that the
# driver core accepts the card in the emulator.  Calibration values (pa*,
# maxp*, rxgains*, *po) of a real card differ.  Replace this file with a dump
# of the real card (tools/re/hwdump.py) before trusting any number that is
# derived from it.

